3:T104a,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Bayfields Opticians?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Bayfields is a group of independent opticians and audiologists that has grown by acquiring established independent practices across England and Wales. Founded in 2015, the group preserves the local character, staff, and patient relationships of each practice while investing in advanced clinical technology and adding audiology services. The result is a network of practices that feel like your trusted local optician but benefit from the resources of a larger group."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will my local practice change now that it has joined Bayfields?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Bayfields' acquisition model is specifically designed to minimise disruption. The staff you know will typically remain, and the practice continues to operate in the same location with the same commitment to personal care. What changes behind the scenes includes investment in new equipment such as OCT scanners, improved staff training programmes, and group purchasing power that can lead to better value for patients. Many patients notice an improvement in available technology without any loss of the personal touch."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Bayfields offer hearing tests?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, many Bayfields practices now offer hearing assessments alongside their optical services. This is part of Bayfields' strategy to create combined opticians-and-audiologists practices. Hearing tests are free, and if hearing loss is identified, a range of private hearing aids is available from leading manufacturers. The availability of audiology services varies by practice, so check when booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where are Bayfields practices located?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Bayfields operates approximately 60 practices across England and Wales. Locations span southern England, the Midlands, East Anglia, and parts of Wales. The group continues to grow by acquiring additional independent practices. You can search for your nearest Bayfields practice by entering your postcode on eyetest.co.uk."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Bayfields an independent opticians?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Bayfields describes itself as a group of independent practices. While the individual practices are now part of the Bayfields group rather than being independently owned, the group's philosophy is to preserve the independent character of each practice. Staff, clinical approaches, and patient relationships are maintained, and each practice retains its community focus. Bayfields is not part of a large multinational corporation like some chain opticians."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does an eye test cost at Bayfields?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"NHS-funded eye tests are free for all eligible patients at Bayfields practices, just as at any other UK optician. Private eye tests start from around £30, and enhanced examinations with OCT scanning are available from approximately £40. Prices may vary slightly between practices. Contact lens assessments start from £35."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Bayfields offer OCT scanning?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Bayfields has invested in OCT (Optical Coherence Tomography) technology across its network, and this scanning is available at most of its practices. OCT provides detailed 3D images of the retina and optic nerve head, enabling early detection of conditions such as glaucoma and macular degeneration. It is available as part of the enhanced eye examination for an additional fee."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a Bayfields appointment through eyetest.co.uk?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Bayfields practices are available for booking through eyetest.co.uk. Simply enter your postcode to find your nearest practice, choose your appointment type, and select a convenient date and time. You will receive an email confirmation with all the details you need for your visit."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Bayfields Opticians & Audiologists\",\"url\":\"https://www.bayfields.com\",\"description\":\"Bayfields is a growing group of independent opticians and audiologists with practices across England and Wales. They have expanded steadily by acquiring established independent practices and retaining their local character, staff, and patient relationships. Bayfields focuses on clinical excellence and offers enhanced eye examinations alongside standard NHS sight tests, with a commitment to investing in advanced diagnostic technology across their network.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2015\",\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"numberOfEmployees\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"name\":\"UK stores\",\"value\":60},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.bayfields.com\"],\"parentOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"eyetest.co.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"}}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Opticians\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/opticians\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Bayfields Opticians & Audiologists\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/opticians/bayfields\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7",false,"$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf"]}],"$L10"],["$L11"],"$L12"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"ssq08EaNRRySny1_GDRUp"}
