5:["$","section",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--color-navy)] mb-6","children":["About ","Bayfields Opticians & Audiologists"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Bayfields is a growing group of independent opticians and audiologists with practices across England and Wales. They have expanded steadily by acquiring established independent practices and retaining their local character, staff, and patient relationships. Bayfields focuses on clinical excellence and offers enhanced eye examinations alongside standard NHS sight tests, with a commitment to investing in advanced diagnostic technology across their network."}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"Bayfields Opticians & Audiologists was established in 2015 as a new kind of optical group with a distinctive acquisition strategy. Rather than building new stores from scratch, Bayfields set out to acquire well-established independent opticians practices across England and Wales, preserving their local identities, retaining their experienced staff, and maintaining the patient relationships that had been built up over years or even decades. The founding vision was that independent opticians offered a level of care and personal attention that patients valued highly, but that many independent owners were reaching retirement age and needed a viable succession plan."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"The group grew rapidly through the late 2010s and into the 2020s, acquiring practices in a wide range of towns and cities across England and Wales. Each acquired practice continued to operate under its existing name in many cases, with Bayfields providing back-office support, group purchasing power, and investment in clinical technology. This model allowed the group to maintain the trusted local feel of each practice while bringing the benefits of scale — including access to the latest OCT scanners, staff training programmes, and audiological equipment."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"Today, Bayfields operates approximately 60 practices and continues to grow. The group has invested heavily in adding audiology services to practices that previously offered only optical care, creating a combined opticians-and-audiologists model similar to that of Scrivens and Leightons. Bayfields positions itself as a clinically focused group that prioritises patient outcomes over volume, and its acquisition model has made it an important player in the consolidation of the UK independent optical sector."}]]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 h-fit","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] mb-4","children":"Quick Facts"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"Founded"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"2015"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"UK Stores"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"60"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":["$L14","$L15"]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}]]}]]}]}]
