32:["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Yes, many Bayfields practices now offer hearing assessments alongside their optical services. This is part of Bayfields' strategy to create combined opticians-and-audiologists practices. Hearing tests are free, and if hearing loss is identified, a range of private hearing aids is available from leading manufacturers. The availability of audiology services varies by practice, so check when booking."}]}]
